WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.003
The Open Compute Project
is a vibrant community

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:06.006
that spans the data center
infrastructure worldwide.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:11.077
Though not a standards body, the
OCP Community forges new technology

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:15.348
norms, fostering an ecosystem where
industry players collaborate in a safe

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:19.352
framework, shaping a versatile
and diverse supply chain.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:23.790
From startups to hyperscalers, as well as
research, academia, and investors,

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:28.561
the OCP Community is able to reduce
procurement time, research efforts,

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:33.333
expenses, development time, and even
legal complexity for your projects.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.969
Participating in the OCP Community

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:38.972
gives you access to the latest
technologies and talent,

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:42.609
the chance to improve your skills,
and to drive impact in critical

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:45.945
areas like energy efficiency,
cooling, and sustainability.

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:49.516
Join one of the many project
workstreams to help solve

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:53.286
challenges and pioneer solutions,
or serve as a volunteer leader

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:57.257
to help steer the community towards
the industry's ever increasing challenges.

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:01.127
If you're seeking cutting edge
solutions, explore our marketplace

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:04.230
or the library of specifications
and other contributions,

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:07.567
and embrace OCP solutions
in your next endeavor,

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:11.604
or make OCP specifications
part of your next RFP.

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:16.443
Check out the latest solutions at an
OCP Experience Center, or partner

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:21.281
with any of our OCP recognized facilities
or OCP solution providers.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:26.052
Contribute specifications, design
files, reference architectures,

00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:28.321
or software, to help solve the industry's

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:31.724
greatest challenges, building
trust in you and your brand.

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:35.595
Connect at OCP events through
attendance and sponsorship

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:38.765
and embrace OCP’s inclusive open spirit.

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:42.936
Because together we're
stronger, faster, and better.
